{"id":"n15456-1-9","stage":4,"title":"간밤 · 昨夜","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15456-1-9-1","ko":"간밤에 잘 주무셨어요?","zh":"您昨晚睡得好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"간밤에","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"간밤：昨夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"간밤","audio":"/audio/40da640ed2f58f2d189d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15456","senseId":"1","lemma":"간밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간밤에","audio":"/audio/85bbfad1a79da167b292.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"주무셨어요?","meaning":"就寝，睡","explanation":"주무시다：就寝，睡；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주무시다","audio":"/audio/32d476b91a3628237da3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62597","senseId":"1","lemma":"주무시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주무셨어요","audio":"/audio/d8ce031c6a17c9545419.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"40da640ed2f58f2d","term":"간밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/40da640ed2f58f2d189d.mp3","entryId":"15456","definition":"昨天晚上；昨晚。","pronunciation":["간밤"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"32d476b91a362823","term":"주무시다","zh":"就寝，睡","audio":"/audio/32d476b91a3628237da3.mp3","entryId":"62597","definition":"(尊称)睡觉。","pronunciation":["주무시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/54f720a68ba940fa4116.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15456-1-9-2","ko":"신경 써 주신 덕분에 푹 잘 잤습니다.","zh":"多亏了您的关心，我睡得非常香。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신경","meaning":"心思、关照（신경 쓰다）","explanation":"신경：心思、关照（신경 쓰다）","readings":[{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI